
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>Activism — Carlina Carpelan</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --black: #000000;
      --blue: #00a6ff;
      --white: #ffffff;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--black);
      color: var(--white);
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .hero {
      background: var(--blue);
      color: var(--black);
      padding: 48px 40px 80px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(82px, 13vw, 190px);
      line-height: 0.82;
      margin: 0;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.08em;
    }

    .links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 42px;
    }

    .links a {
      color: var(--black);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--black);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 10px 22px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition:
        background 0.2s ease,
        color 0.2s ease,
        transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .links a:hover {
      background: var(--black);
      color: var(--blue);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    main {
      padding: 90px 40px;
      max-width: 1100px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin: 0;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    }

    footer {
      background: var(--blue);
      color: var(--black);
      padding: 36px 40px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero {
        padding: 40px 24px 64px;
      }

      main {
        padding: 70px 24px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(64px, 18vw, 120px);
      }

      .links {
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .links a {
        font-size: 16px;
        padding: 10px 18px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">

    <header class="hero">

      <h1>
        Activism
      </h1>

      <div class="links">

        <a href="index.html">
          Home
        </a>

        <a href="dj.html">
          DJ
        </a>

        <a href="events.html">
          Events
        </a>

        <a href="contact.html">
          Contact
        </a>

      </div>

    </header>

    <main>

      <p>
        Carlina Carpelan is involved in Metsäliike, works as a nature advocate focusing on lobbying at Greenpeace, and is currently co-founding a new activist collective centered around the ideology of Planetary Care.
      </p>

    </main>

    <footer>
      Carlina Carpelan
    </footer>

  </div>

</body>

</html>
